  "display_title": "Can't Get Enough of You",
  "description": "After losing his parents in a tragic car accident at a young age, Tae-Jun Kim vows never to forgive those responsible. Now, as an adult, fate reunites him with So-Eun Han, the daughter of the driver who took his parents' lives. Young, powerful, rich, and handsome Tae-Jun is hungry for revenge and will bully So-Eun until he feels satisfied. However, complications arise when love enters the equation, blurring the line between resentment and affection. A story in the making, in which \"I will never forgive them!\" turns into \"I think I like you...\". \n\n(Source: WEBTOON, edited)",
